<title>@ViewData["Title"] Tooth Extraction</title>

@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
    ViewData["FullWidthLayout"] = true;
}

<div class="Teeth-Extraction-hero">
    <div class="overlay text-center">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Tooth Extraction</h1>
        <p class="lead">Sometimes, removing a tooth is the best step toward better oral health. 
            At DenTeeth, our tooth extraction services are performed with care, precision, and your comfort in mind — ensuring a smooth, stress-free experience from start to finish.</p>
        <p class="lead">Tooth extraction may be necessary due to severe decay, infection, gum disease, overcrowding, or impacted wisdom teeth. 
            Our experienced dental team will first assess your condition and explain all treatment options before proceeding.</p>
        <p class="lead">The procedure is carried out under local anesthesia to minimize discomfort, and we offer post-extraction care guidance to promote fast healing and prevent complications. 
            For more complex extractions, such as surgical removal of impacted teeth, we use advanced tools and techniques to ensure safe and efficient outcomes.</p>
        <p class="lead">At DenTeeth, we prioritize preserving your long-term oral health, and if needed, we’ll discuss tooth replacement solutions like dental implants or bridges after your extraction.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <a href="/Appointment/Book" class="btn btn-outline-light px-4">Make Appointment</a>
            <a href="/Home/Index/#Our_Service" class="btn btn-dark px-4">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>